@startuml speed_approx
participant pipeline
participant stroke_length
participant speed_approximation
participant least_squares
hide footbox
pipeline -> speed_approximation: Approximate speed (twists, positions, minimas)
speed_approximation -> speed_approximation: Split trajectory\nbetween minimas
speed_approximation -> stroke_length: Compute strokes length (positions, minimas)
stroke_length --> speed_approximation: Ds

speed_approximation -> speed_approximation: Compute segment speed\nfrom twists
loop for each segment
  speed_approximation -> least_squares: Fit segment speed profile\nwith lognormal (speed, D)
  least_squares --> least_squares: Lognormal parameters that\nminimize MSE against speed
  least_squares --> speed_approximation: Lognormal parameters\n(mu, sigma, t0)
  speed_approximation -> speed_approximation: Subtract the stroke\nfrom speed
end

speed_approximation --> pipeline: Approximated speed parameters (mu, sigma, t0, D)
@enduml